100-101:cross
110-111:cross
120-121:cross

# --- phase 2: gate 1 — "Confirm Settings" (OPTIONS), then Yes
130-131:options
140-140.15:up
148-149:cross

# --- phase 3: dismiss "Settings can be adjusted at any time in the Options menu." and enter
#     the Grade Shop. Cross on the Grade Shop buys the highlighted bonus, which is harmless.
160-161:cross
170-171:cross
180-181:cross
190-191:cross

# --- phase 4: gate 2 — "Start Game" (OPTIONS), then Yes
200-201:options
210-210.15:up
218-219:cross

# --- phase 5: second pass over gate 1, for a slow boot
300-301:options
310-310.15:up
318-319:cross
330-331:cross
340-341:cross
350-351:cross

# --- phase 6: second pass over gate 2, for a slow boot
